Package: agecraft
Type: Package
Title: Age Calculation and Grouping
Version: 0.1.0.9025
Authors@R: person(
    "Russ", "Jones",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "RussJones007@gmail.com",
    comment = NULL
  )
Description: Calculate ages from calendar dates or elapsed time with units such as 
    years, months, weeks, and days. Explicit unit conversion for ages included.  
    The calculated ages from dates and date-times retain fractional precision with 
    time units. Age ranges or intervals with fractional boundaries and 
    optional names can be used to group/categorize ages into ordered categories. 
    Includes reusable age-interval definitions and an age interval scheme system for 
    provenance information. 
